1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:10,320
I will tell story "The Wings of the White Horse" second time along with illustration.

2
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:16,350
The Wings of the White Horse

3
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:24,000
Long ago, there was a very innocent White Horse.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,420
Mother horse loved him very much.

5
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:36,770
Mother often reminded:

6
00:00:36,770 --> 00:00:44,920
- Neigh loudly whenever you need to call me!

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,620
Near White Horse's house was Eagle Brother.

8
00:00:53,620 --> 00:01:01,650
He spread wings very firmly.

9
00:01:01,650 --> 00:01:13,100
White Horse loved it very much, he kept wishing to be like Eagle Brother.

10
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:19,870
Eagle Brother said to White Horse:

11
00:01:19,870 --> 00:01:30,950
- You must go find! If you keep lingering with mother, when will you have wings.

12
00:01:32,320 --> 00:01:42,450
So White Horse asked mother's permission to go on journey with Eagle Brother.

13
00:01:42,450 --> 00:01:58,570
In a moment went far... Haven't seen "wings" yet but White Horse saw many strange sights.

14
00:01:59,150 --> 00:02:03,720
Sky was getting dark.

15
00:02:05,470 --> 00:02:13,120
Suddenly sound "hoo... oo... oo" sounded nearer and nearer.

16
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:22,750
Then in darkness appeared a Gray Wolf standing blocking path.

17
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:35,270
When Gray Wolf jumped at White Horse, Eagle Brother had arrived to strike strongly right on Gray Wolf's forehead.

18
00:02:35,270 --> 00:02:41,700
Wolf cried out: - Ouch!

19
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:47,420
Then Wolf tucked tail ran back to forest.

20
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:56,050
White Horse opened eyes seeing Eagle Brother's shadow.

21
00:02:56,050 --> 00:03:06,270
White Horse cried again, called mother, wanted to return to mother but had no wings.

22
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:14,650
Eagle Brother laughed, pointed at White Horse's four legs.

23
00:03:14,650 --> 00:03:25,200
- Those are your wings! If traveling far, you "fly" faster than me!

24
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:36,000
Eagle Brother spread wings, White Horse jumped up and saw his four legs truly flew like Eagle Brother's wings.

